  m_Name: Beginning Story
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: "For a long time, humanity thought they were the only inhabitants
    of Zorapterra, until the mining corporation, Human Planetary Services, breached
    an unknown alien species\u2019 home. The aliens ravaged the humans on the planet
    and pushed them off. It is now up to you, a soldier sent by H.P.S. to retake
    the planet\u2019s caves and send the aliens into extinction for humanity\u2019s
    sake."
  displayDuration: 5
